Okay, so the timing of this guys was that that my show, Malcolm in the Middle, had ended production in March of 2006, and so that freed me up.
好吧，伙计们，当时的背景是，我的剧《马尔科姆的一家》在2006年3月结束了制作，这让我有了空闲。

