I mean, it's crazy to think now it's such a common thing that you can watch three seasons on a weekend, you're up to speed, you can now watch it in real time if you want, but for the all of television history up until that moment, you would have to hop in on whatever season they were airing.
现在想来这太疯狂了，在周末就能连看三季，迅速追上进度，如果愿意的话还能实时观看，这已经成了稀松平常的事，但在那一刻之前的整个电视史上，你只能赶上他们正在播出的那一季。

00:30:38.940 --> 00:30:43.779
I mean, there was no ability other than like DVD box sets when that started happening.
我的意思是，除了后来开始出现的DVD盒装套装外，别无他法。

