I really think streaming helped because it's such, our show is very bingeable for a sitcom And God knows watching Breaking Bad a whole bunch in a row is so rewarding because everything is so cleverly It's great It was great watching it on air and having a wait a week But seeing the brilliance of that storytelling of how Breaking Bad was written and constructed watching them all in a row is very rewarding It was it was fun.
我真的认为流媒体帮了大忙，因为作为一部情景喜剧，我们的剧非常适合一口气刷完，而且上帝知道，连着看很多集《极品飞车》……不对，《绝命毒师》是如此过瘾，因为一切都构思得那么巧妙。太棒了，在电视上播的时候每周等一集的感觉很棒，但连着看能看出《绝命毒师》的编剧和架构是多么的精妙，这种体验非常过瘾，非常有趣。

