00:34:18.929 --> 00:34:43.530
Yes, but Vince was like no, I don't care about like he's the he was so good in this one episode of X miles 10 years ago he actually literally overnited the disc of that one 2006 yeah overnited the disc of that episode So I mean, to the executives at AMC and to the executives at Sony and he said, watch this and then then we'll talk.
是的，但文斯觉得，不，我不在乎那些，他在10年前的《X档案》某一集里表现得太棒了，他甚至把那集2006年的光盘连夜寄了过去，对，连夜把那集的DVD寄给了AMC的高管们，还有索尼的高管们，他说：“看看这个，然后我们再聊。”

